ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi036: OPEN_SHELL with one ADVANCED_FACE on a CYLINDRICAL_SURFACE (radius 1, axis +Z, height 2); FACE_OUTER_BOUND references an EDGE_LOOP containing: top semi-circle arc (v_top_0→v_top_pi, U: 0→π), right lateral line (v_top_pi→v_bot_pi, down at theta=π), bottom semi-circle arc reversed (v_bot_pi→v_bot_0, U: π→0), left lateral line (v_bot_0→v_top_0, up at theta=0); the top arc ends at UV (π, H) and right lateral starts at UV (π+0.01, H) — shared 3D vertex v_top_pi but pcurve endpoints differ by Δu=0.01 IS the mechanism (lacking edge: UV gap not closable by vertex tolerance); EDGE_LOOP IS wired into FACE_OUTER_BOUND, ADVANCED_FACE, OPEN_SHELL; kernel must synthesise bridging edge or reject topology-vs-parametrisation mismatch */
HEADER;
